      "apiDescription": "## Props\n\n```\nexport type SkeletonProps = {\n  /**\n   * whether showing the animation\n   *\n   * @default false\n   */\n  animated?: boolean;\n  /**\n   * how many fake items to render to the DOM\n   *\n   * @default 1\n   */\n  count?: number;\n  /**\n   * numbers of the row, only useful when no template slot were given\n   *\n   * @default 3\n   */\n  rows?: number;\n  /**\n   * displays the real content (`default` slot) or the loading skeleton\n   *\n   * @default true\n   */\n  loading?: boolean;\n  /**\n   * Rendering delay in milliseconds, or `{ leading, trailing, initVal }`\n   * to control the leading/trailing edges independently\n   */\n  throttle?: number | ThrottleConfig;\n}\n```\n\n## Slots\n\nEach slot is typed with the props it passes to its content.\n\n```\nexport type SkeletonSlots = {\n  /** Custom rendering skeleton template */\n  template: {};\n  /** Real rendering DOM */\n  default: {};\n}\n```\n\n## Exposed\n\nAvailable on the component instance through a template ref.\n\n```\nexport type SkeletonExposed = {\n  ns: NamespaceHelpers;\n  uiLoading: boolean;\n}\n```",
